  "request": "Issue #374: c94f: [BUG] Fix unmet plugin foundation acceptance criteria\n\nGoal: Fix unmet plugin foundation acceptance criteria.\nScope: hook discovery import-boundary rejection, snapshot hook hard-fail behavior for disabled/removed/unresolved/metadata-mismatched plugins or hooks, and plugin artifact storage under the spec directory.\nDescription: The plugin foundation still allows core-internal hook imports, treats broken snapshot plugin/hook references as warnings, and writes artifacts under .senti instead of the required spec-local plugin-artifacts location. Business failures during hook execution should remain warnings and issue-log candidates.",
